(5816408, 847571, 60173, '<td valign="top">Okay, this is weird... I was looking for something today in the closet, and I found my high school flute. I almost did this exact same image, except I was going to include the left pinky key because it looked like a nose.<br/> <br/>I was going to do my version pulled out a little bit and use the velvet blue case as a background. I think I like your version better. More in your face so to speak.</td>', 'Okay, this is weird... I was looking for something today in the closet, and I found my high school flute. I almost did this exact same image, except I was going to include the left pinky key because it looked like a nose. I was going to do my version pulled out a little bit and use the velvet blue case as a background. I think I like your version better. More in your face so to speak.', '2010-01-18 04:09:41.000000', NULL, 1),
