(5817026, 847573, 10785, '<td valign="top">It''s just toooo funny! Even though this shot has a lot of grey tones and is not too bright, what it lacks in color, it makes up for in humor. It''s just too darn funny to mark low!</td>', 'It''s just toooo funny! Even though this shot has a lot of grey tones and is not too bright, what it lacks in color, it makes up for in humor. It''s just too darn funny to mark low!', '2010-01-18 16:20:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5817038, 847650, 10785, '<td valign="top">Took me a minute or two to see the face... Very imaginative and it does emit some emotion with the bowed down look. However, I think the tonal range of the shot is fairly blown with too bright highlights and too dark shadows.</td>', 'Took me a minute or two to see the face... Very imaginative and it does emit some emotion with the bowed down look. However, I think the tonal range of the shot is fairly blown with too bright highlights and too dark shadows.', '2010-01-18 16:27:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5817047, 846407, 10785, '<td valign="top">My daughter throws one of these on the ground about 10 times a day... YOu''d think the string attachments would work, but nope... They get yanked right off too! My wife has a bit of a soothie buying problem as well. She needs at least five on the night stand, five in the diaper bag and a few in each car so she is never without one. I think we even have two in the kitchen...Ok. But enough about me.<br/> <br/>I think it is the material the soothie is made of rather than your focusing, but it just looks a little out of focus. I think a black background might have helped that and given it a little pop from the page.</td>', 'My daughter throws one of these on the ground about 10 times a day... YOu''d think the string attachments would work, but nope... They get yanked right off too! My wife has a bit of a soothie buying problem as well. She needs at least five on the night stand, five in the diaper bag and a few in each car so she is never without one. I think we even have two in the kitchen...Ok. But enough about me. I think it is the material the soothie is made of rather than your focusing, but it just looks a little out of focus. I think a black background might have helped that and given it a little pop from the page.', '2010-01-18 16:33:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5817050, 847570, 10785, '<td valign="top">I really don''t think the overblown highlights matter much because it adds to create the look of the face.</td>', 'I really don''t think the overblown highlights matter much because it adds to create the look of the face.', '2010-01-18 16:36:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5817060, 847660, 30861, '<td valign="top">Not all *that* well photographed, technically, but oh! So well seen! An 8 from me. Killer thumb, especially.</td>', 'Not all *that* well photographed, technically, but oh! So well seen! An 8 from me. Killer thumb, especially.', '2010-01-18 16:44:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5817067, 847226, 30861, '<td valign="top">But it ain''t a smile, it''s a frown :-(</td>', 'But it ain''t a smile, it''s a frown :-(', '2010-01-18 16:48:44.000000', NULL, 1),
