(5817226, 847319, 10785, '<td valign="top">This is just sooo humorous as a set up! It does look just a tad dark, but otherwise very clean!</td>', 'This is just sooo humorous as a set up! It does look just a tad dark, but otherwise very clean!', '2010-01-18 19:23:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5817233, 846951, 10785, '<td valign="top">Good vision in seeing the face! You got great even lighting and avoided any harsh shadows showing great technique though it is lacking in depth. I think it lacks a little of what flickr calls interestingness due to the whole shot consisting mostly of wood...</td>', 'Good vision in seeing the face! You got great even lighting and avoided any harsh shadows showing great technique though it is lacking in depth. I think it lacks a little of what flickr calls interestingness due to the whole shot consisting mostly of wood...', '2010-01-18 19:26:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5817240, 847543, 10785, '<td valign="top">Too funny. I think Groucho Marx when I see these clouds. I think the photo is somewhat dark though I don''t see how it could have been done any other way because the comedic effect comes in the contrast between the pink and black clouds.</td>', 'Too funny. I think Groucho Marx when I see these clouds. I think the photo is somewhat dark though I don''t see how it could have been done any other way because the comedic effect comes in the contrast between the pink and black clouds.', '2010-01-18 19:29:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5817243, 847690, 10785, '<td valign="top">Turn that frown upside down and you''ll see a smile! Nice vision.</td>', 'Turn that frown upside down and you''ll see a smile! Nice vision.', '2010-01-18 19:30:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5817244, 847687, 10785, '<td valign="top">I think instead of showing the whole lute, you could have zoomed in to show only the face making it have much more effect. I think you could have kept the same angle.</td>', 'I think instead of showing the whole lute, you could have zoomed in to show only the face making it have much more effect. I think you could have kept the same angle.', '2010-01-18 19:31:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5817248, 847616, 10785, '<td valign="top">I like the flash bounced of the "eyes". It gives this "robot" a powered on feel. (Like it is alive!) The only piece of criticism I can think to say is that I feel the foreground is not too much lighter than the background which makes it not stand out so much.</td>', 'I like the flash bounced of the "eyes". It gives this "robot" a powered on feel. (Like it is alive!) The only piece of criticism I can think to say is that I feel the foreground is not too much lighter than the background which makes it not stand out so much.', '2010-01-18 19:36:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5817250, 847389, 10785, '<td valign="top">Somehow I feel like somebody is watching me...</td>', 'Somehow I feel like somebody is watching me...', '2010-01-18 19:37:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5817253, 847438, 10785, '<td valign="top">Super awesome photo. I think the face would be seen better by zooming in and leaving out the background. So I''d crop this much tighter!</td>', 'Super awesome photo. I think the face would be seen better by zooming in and leaving out the background. So I''d crop this much tighter!', '2010-01-18 19:40:34.000000', NULL, 1),
