(5819890, 847583, 83313, '<td valign="top">I really like the textures and green tones here. This has a lot of dimension to it.</td>', 'I really like the textures and green tones here. This has a lot of dimension to it.', '2010-01-20 15:16:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5819893, 847319, 83313, '<td valign="top">The photo itself it not the best. Lighting seems a bit unflattering. Not sure if this was just existing light, or if you added some flash. However, it''s an outstanding idea that made me smile, so a positive vote for what you did accomplish with it.</td>', 'The photo itself it not the best. Lighting seems a bit unflattering. Not sure if this was just existing light, or if you added some flash. However, it''s an outstanding idea that made me smile, so a positive vote for what you did accomplish with it.', '2010-01-20 15:18:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5819897, 847572, 83313, '<td valign="top">The faces were already painted on these mugs, so I''m not sure if it really  suits the spirit of the challenge.</td>', 'The faces were already painted on these mugs, so I''m not sure if it really  suits the spirit of the challenge.', '2010-01-20 15:21:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5819899, 847682, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like the view and treatment, though I think it may be cropped a little tight.</td>', 'I like the view and treatment, though I think it may be cropped a little tight.', '2010-01-20 15:22:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5819901, 847650, 83313, '<td valign="top">Excellent! I''m curious if you created the paper face, or just happened to notice it in the crumpled paper and decided it would be a good entry.</td>', 'Excellent! I''m curious if you created the paper face, or just happened to notice it in the crumpled paper and decided it would be a good entry.', '2010-01-20 15:24:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5819905, 847519, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''m afraid this one is not coming off to me well. The photo itself seems a snapshot and the placing of drawn eyes and nostrils on paper does not seem to me to suit the concept of the challenge. Without that piece of paper, there would not be any face in this scene.</td>', 'I''m afraid this one is not coming off to me well. The photo itself seems a snapshot and the placing of drawn eyes and nostrils on paper does not seem to me to suit the concept of the challenge. Without that piece of paper, there would not be any face in this scene.', '2010-01-20 15:26:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5819908, 847565, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''ve got to assume you didn''t understand the challenge topic. In addition, it comes off as just a snapshot, and there is an excessive amount of JPEG compression that is taking away a lot of the detail in this. Compression kills detail. Always use the least amount of compression you can get away with and still slip it under the 300k challenge limit.</td>', 'I''ve got to assume you didn''t understand the challenge topic. In addition, it comes off as just a snapshot, and there is an excessive amount of JPEG compression that is taking away a lot of the detail in this. Compression kills detail. Always use the least amount of compression you can get away with and still slip it under the 300k challenge limit.', '2010-01-20 15:30:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5819912, 847559, 83313, '<td valign="top">Funny stuff! Some problems that I think will hold it down, however. The texture of your background paper shows up as a graininess similar to ISO noise. (I''ve done it myself. It looks smoother than it is to the camera.) Since this is an advanced editing challenge, you could have used some selective editing to smooth it out.</td>', 'Funny stuff! Some problems that I think will hold it down, however. The texture of your background paper shows up as a graininess similar to ISO noise. (I''ve done it myself. It looks smoother than it is to the camera.) Since this is an advanced editing challenge, you could have used some selective editing to smooth it out.', '2010-01-20 15:33:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5819921, 847660, 43463, '<td valign="top">That''s not a coffee pot...that is pure grinning evil!:-) The downward ''v'' curveture of the ''eyes'' and that grin makes the coffee pot look downright evil and up to no good. Ekk! Almost makes one want to avoid going to the kitchen to get the morning coffee. Very creative use of reflections!</td>', 'That''s not a coffee pot...that is pure grinning evil!:-) The downward ''v'' curveture of the ''eyes'' and that grin makes the coffee pot look downright evil and up to no good. Ekk! Almost makes one want to avoid going to the kitchen to get the morning coffee. Very creative use of reflections!', '2010-01-20 15:43:34.000000', NULL, 1),
