(5820153, 847319, 66384, '<td valign="top">Love the setup. Wish the lighting and image quality were better. Needs to be sharper, and the color balance needs adjustment.</td>', 'Love the setup. Wish the lighting and image quality were better. Needs to be sharper, and the color balance needs adjustment.', '2010-01-20 17:58:37.000000', NULL, 1);
