(5820810, 847654, 93565, '<td valign="top">I like the lensbaby choice- but I think having the focus on the nose so that only the face was in focus might have benefited things. Still a nice photo.</td>', 'I like the lensbaby choice- but I think having the focus on the nose so that only the face was in focus might have benefited things. Still a nice photo.', '2010-01-21 06:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
