(5820814, 847651, 93565, '<td valign="top">Nice take on things. Your subject matter separates itself from the pack nicely. I''m undecided about the bones in the background and the treatment you''ve given them, but overall like your photo.</td>', 'Nice take on things. Your subject matter separates itself from the pack nicely. I''m undecided about the bones in the background and the treatment you''ve given them, but overall like your photo.', '2010-01-21 06:41:50.000000', NULL, 1),
