(5820817, 846924, 93565, '<td valign="top">Nice job using the borders to support your photo; it''s an interesting application. Maybe consider making things perfectly symmetrical (referring to the bit of white on the left)?</td>', 'Nice job using the borders to support your photo; it''s an interesting application. Maybe consider making things perfectly symmetrical (referring to the bit of white on the left)?', '2010-01-21 06:46:44.000000', NULL, 1),
