(5821135, 847559, 43463, '<td valign="top">While not a true smile or frown I gotta give you applause for the level of creativity here. The title is what helps enforce the idea of a happy staple gun fish finding some small fry staples in the ocean. Love the addition of the green yarn kelp for it helps add to the illusion of this being a seascape scene. Lighting is also very good for all objects are well illuminated without any deep or harsh shadows. Very creative!</td>', 'While not a true smile or frown I gotta give you applause for the level of creativity here. The title is what helps enforce the idea of a happy staple gun fish finding some small fry staples in the ocean. Love the addition of the green yarn kelp for it helps add to the illusion of this being a seascape scene. Lighting is also very good for all objects are well illuminated without any deep or harsh shadows. Very creative!', '2010-01-21 11:03:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5821140, 847487, 43463, '<td valign="top">Not a true smile or frown but very creative use of objects to create a face! I see this ''table'' face as an aloof guy just leaning back on the wall and puffing away at his ciggie. Photo is technically excellent in color tones, lighting and composition. I have to be honest with you, I am docking a few points because of the no true smile or frown - still it remains in the above average category - 7.</td>', 'Not a true smile or frown but very creative use of objects to create a face! I see this ''table'' face as an aloof guy just leaning back on the wall and puffing away at his ciggie. Photo is technically excellent in color tones, lighting and composition. I have to be honest with you, I am docking a few points because of the no true smile or frown - still it remains in the above average category - 7.', '2010-01-21 11:09:48.000000', NULL, 1),
