(5824027, 847522, 104230, '<td valign="top">Fun composition. I like it but there are a couple of things that bother me .. 1) the bright area in the gap between the longer part of the towel and the edge, I think that perhaps a tighter crop would have worked better. 2) the flexible hose running past the "nose" and "mouth".. it seems likely that this could have been held aside out of the frame, and I think that would have made for a better composition.</td>', 'Fun composition. I like it but there are a couple of things that bother me .. 1) the bright area in the gap between the longer part of the towel and the edge, I think that perhaps a tighter crop would have worked better. 2) the flexible hose running past the "nose" and "mouth".. it seems likely that this could have been held aside out of the frame, and I think that would have made for a better composition.', '2010-01-22 15:13:23.000000', NULL, 1),
