(5831195, 847565, 57229, '<td valign="top">Welcome on board, Roisin. I have a hatful of ''brown ribbons'' as they''re known - I even crafted one to commemorate them. Needless to say, it''s freely available for all to display and I have to present it to you as you''ve pipped me for it this time - <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=602147" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/55000-59999/57229/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_602147.gif'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/55000-59999/57229/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_602147.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/55000-59999/57229/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_602147.gif"/></a> <br/>As Oscar Wilde would have it, we are all in the gutter but some of us are looking at the stars. The only way from here is up :)<br/>Nice kids.</td>', 'Welcome on board, Roisin. I have a hatful of ''brown ribbons'' as they''re known - I even crafted one to commemorate them. Needless to say, it''s freely available for all to display and I have to present it to you as you''ve pipped me for it this time -  As Oscar Wilde would have it, we are all in the gutter but some of us are looking at the stars. The only way from here is up :)Nice kids.', '2010-01-25 03:48:51.000000', NULL, 0),
